    You vanish, lines of light cross the enemy you face, and you reappear behind it. A moment later all the cuts land at once.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Hold Triangle (U) to cast. 45 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 435339178}
  text: {fileID: 1625356815}
  back: {fileID: 1994462474}
  shown: {fileID: 1983791321}
  lineHeight: 0.17
  letterWidth: 0.075
