  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'EMBER RAIN (Fire, the ''rain'' form)

    Strikes fall at random over an area ahead for a few seconds, each marked on the ground first.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Hold Triangle (U) to cast. 40 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
