  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 694925d99107355428ee965f7b9638b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'GALE STEP (Wind, the ''step'' form)

    You step through the enemy you face and cut it in passing. If it lands, your next heavy blow soon after is critical.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Hold Triangle (U) to cast. 20 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 1012146845}
  text: {fileID: 2080240183}
  back: {fileID: 583126321}
  shown: {fileID: 915747520}
  lineHeight: 0.17
  letterWidth: 0.075
