  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'SECOND SHADOW (Dark, the ''clone'' form)

    A copy of you stands beside you and repeats every weapon blow a beat late, weaker.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Hold Triangle (U) to cast. 40 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
