  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'GLACIER WALL (Ice, the ''wall'' form)

    A wall rises ahead and blocks the way. It bursts when its time ends or when you strike it with a heavy blow.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Hold Triangle (U) to cast. 30 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 1860591628}
  text: {fileID: 1232962032}
  back: {fileID: 985094434}
  shown: {fileID: 111968820}
  lineHeight: 0.17
  letterWidth: 0.075
